Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.93,0:01:33.13,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, darlin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.05,0:01:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, darlin'. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我们需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? Do we need to …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 暂时没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. We're okay for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good afternoon to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.15,0:02:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在见到你 我觉得浑身舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm feelin' all kinds of glad to see you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.77,0:02:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你最近上夜班 今晚也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you were pullin' late shift, and you wanna tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不想吵醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I didn't want to wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.27,0:02:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something with the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克要带她去找山顶寨的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick's taking her to the doctor at Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不知道 但我要跟他去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know it yet, but I'm going with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们才刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we just started this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我希望你… - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but I wanted you to… - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.89,0:03:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.78,0:03:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.80,0:03:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到你下半辈子的第一天 萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the first day of the rest of your life, Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天要帮我确保一切回归正轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna help make sure things get back on track today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.67,0:03:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你聪明性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are smart, hot as hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.69,0:03:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊严高尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}dignified as shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.86,0:03:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忍受不了蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't suffer one goddamn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人想看你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's gonna wanna watch you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.93,0:03:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你没必要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但总得有人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But someone does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多也许是几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a couple others … tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不用 大部分人也不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not you and not most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要解决一些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gonna help solve some shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuck in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是个大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I want it stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要尼根死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Negan dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't just be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谋杀的那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl you murdered…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫丹妮斯 是一名医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name was Denise, and she was a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救治了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she helped people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞄准的不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't aiming for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手 动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想这样结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna end it this way…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能只是来看看你是否在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could just be here to see if you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能信任他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.75,0:06:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He owned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不再是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是为了某个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was doing it for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最近跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是为了她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you because of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有另一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达里尔 你认识她 - 尼根信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl, you knew her. - Negan trusts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以合作 我们可以阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can work together, we can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识之前的我 也认识现在的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew me then, and you know me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我没有撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓住了萨沙 如果她还活着的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have Sasha, if she's even alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.96,0:07:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不早说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能是我们救回她的唯一机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be our only chance to get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.35,0:07:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不信任他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我信任达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I trust Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.65,0:07:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根马上就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan's coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概会来三辆卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three trucks probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和二十名救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 saviors and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.11,0:07:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以拖住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can slow them down,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄些树把路挡住\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring some trees down in the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你们争取一点准备的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}buy a little time for you guys to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你们能把他们干掉 我们就起了个好头\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can take them out, that's where we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀了他们之后 我就会发消息到救世堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill them, I'll radio back to the sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sanctuary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根的住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where negan lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是这么叫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会发消息给他们 告诉他们一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can radio back to them and say everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把卡车开回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive the trucks back,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.02,0:08:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以领着你们直捣黄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can lead you right inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如计划得好 我们能把残党都干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, with the right plan, we can wipe out the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去看看你们的朋友是否还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check to see if your friend's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们把工人拉拢到我们这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, we get the workers on our side,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,增加人数\N{\fnArial\fs30}build our numbers up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一个个哨站杀过去 结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go from outpost to outpost and end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:08:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚开始了 这整场战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just started it … the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他在撒谎 我会慢慢折磨死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's lyin', I'm gonna kill him real slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这一切结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管他是不是悔过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a damn if he's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.57,0:09:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了那个混蛋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早已经完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我觉得我们可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is, I figured we'd …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你梦到我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a dream about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.64,0:10:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我需要你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I need from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出来的时候 别吱声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you come out, not a peep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会投降 假如他们还没有投降的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will stand down, if they haven't already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 露西尔会杀掉三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, Lucille here, well, she gets her three,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们带着全新的认知继续前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we move forward with a new understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在…你是在逗我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you … are you shitting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真的眼泪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以配合 但没必要杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it, but no one has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,惩罚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punishment …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没它什么都做不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do anything without that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拥有的一切都是建立在惩罚之上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punishment is how we built everything we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会坐视你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm gonna sit here and let you…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做什么轮不到你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not letting me do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只死一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来打算选三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I was gonna pull three outta the pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只杀一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but just one,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:11:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你才这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用死一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one person has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是把我玩弄于股掌之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me wrapped around your little finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟男女无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not a man woman thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 就算你有根老二\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if you had a dick,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是会有这种感觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would still have these feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,45分钟后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We roll out in 45.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没争取到海边旅馆 但我们有他们的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we don't have Oceanside, but we have their guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而尼根手里有萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan has Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔希望我们相信德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl wants us to trust Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克希望我们留在这以防不测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick wants us to stay here in case things go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样还有另一手牌可打\N{\fnArial\fs30}so there's another card to play,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个救世军以为受他们控制的安全之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}another safe place the Saviors think they control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不知道格雷戈里已经离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he doesn't know that Gregory's gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他告诉了他们一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That maybe he's telling them things,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让他们改变想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll make them think something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是会发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's all about to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在考虑领导山顶寨反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're thinking of leading the Hilltop over there to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.17,0:13:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果尼根发现他们在计划什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Negan finds out they're planning something,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就需要帮助了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're gonna need help,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然那些拾荒者都站在他们那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with those scavengers on their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.69,0:13:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须现在就决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you'd have to decide right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是个艰难的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's a very tough decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很高兴你是为我们做决定的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm glad you're the one making it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.99,0:13:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:13:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道你能做出决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,端起枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns up, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前见过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要一个人伏击他们吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna ambush them on your own? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不可以一个人单干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going alone doesn't work for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀过他们的人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you killed any of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你杀过 并且被他们发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you have and they've found out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也许会认为是神之国干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they may think it was the Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会失去有利条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we lose our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了行尸搞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能把路障移开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we move them aside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试图抹杀从前的自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you seek to extinguish everything of who you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't seek it, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:15:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知所从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让救世军们死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the Saviors dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.12,0:16:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摩根 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morgan. - Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止你的愚行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease this folly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accompany my regiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军就像多头巨龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors are a dragon with many heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵多将广\N{\fnArial\fs30}their numbers legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须寻求盟友与之一战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must seek allies in this endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是本杰明的盔甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Benjamin's armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.79,0:16:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿着是为了保护自己 还是为了纪念他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wear it to serve you, or do you wear it in his honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有走投无路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我们的旅程 结为盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join us on this journey to create an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:16:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们一起战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会打败他们 不会再让别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we shall defeat them so that no one will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他们玩弄蹂躏\N{\fnArial\fs30}under their capricious malevolence ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为了逝者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we start once more for the fallen…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Kingdom…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了胜利的荣耀再次战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for the glory of victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为何而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you fight for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为了这个地方 而是为了彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the place … the people, each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:18:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们也是我们一员了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a part of that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只拿 不费心 这是我们的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take. We don't bother …our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许该换种方式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你男人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.09,0:19:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过后要睡他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lay with him after.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You care?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该回去干活了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should get back to work. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是他们干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think this was them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有后备计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I might be so bold…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这突然的阻碍让我\N{\fnArial\fs30}this unexpected stoppage has given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机会能好好考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}the chance for an exhaustive mull.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据现在的严峻形势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, given the loaded circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有潜在的伤亡和资源消耗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and potential for casualties and resource expenditure,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能给我个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering if you would give me the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去劝降他们 让他们冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}to attempt to slow their jets and cool their roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前用过这种枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot one of these before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.15,0:21:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去另一个塔 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be on the next one over. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.09,0:21:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头行动视野更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more sight lines if we split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.26,0:21:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.53,0:22:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.14,0:22:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.21,0:22:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道会发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's gonna happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会如何结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}How this is gonna end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.43,0:22:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道会发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's gonna happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会如何结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}How this is gonna end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要一起走出那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna walk out that door together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,同甘共苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kick shit and eat snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.43,0:23:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们就是这样 - 我们这次可以袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's us. - We can sit this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.69,0:23:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他们也需要我们留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need us here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.79,0:23:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克说要准备好战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick said to get ready for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.22,0:23:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.14,0:23:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时在沙滩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were at the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在灾变前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.69,0:23:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被水卷了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got pulled under…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.41,0:23:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没能出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't come back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着去找你 但是你不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to find you, but you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.59,0:23:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我开始溺水\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, I started to drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.55,0:23:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌沙滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.01,0:23:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着橡胶衣玩一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the day in a wet suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.36,0:23:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到车上的每一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you're sandblasting your nutsack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.07,0:23:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋都像在被喷砂\N{\fnArial\fs30}every single step you take back to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.82,0:24:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好今天不去海边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily, the seaside ain't on the agenda today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就守卫和巡街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just security and some road to chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.73,0:24:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? So, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.78,0:24:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去帮玛姬 - 亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go help Maggie. - Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.65,0:24:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.11,0:24:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can use us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.57,0:24:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这一次 我们不逞英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just once, we sit one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.30,0:24:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别人… - 应该是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone else … - it should be us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.26,0:24:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬应该靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's gotta take care of maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃过敏药的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you, uh, changed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.28,0:24:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}about taking that allergy medication?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.83,0:24:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.19,0:24:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你会适应这个地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll get adjusted to the place, sinus-wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.69,0:24:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有自己的出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.97,0:24:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别因为我的选择批判我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go and yuck my yum for takin' mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.79,0:24:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说 你也选的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, I may add, is the same as yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.62,0:25:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果今天有人死 都是死在自己的选择上\N{\fnArial\fs30}If people die today, it's 'cause of the choices they made.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.96,0:25:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.98,0:25:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.98,0:25:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.90,0:25:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.29,0:25:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.43,0:25:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll signal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.48,0:25:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙没问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the wall's gonna hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.30,0:25:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.25,0:26:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已被包围\N{\fnArial\fs30}All points are covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.75,0:26:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有意外都在考虑内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every contingency is already met.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.66,0:26:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带着真相前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come armed with two barrels of the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.91,0:26:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,考验将至 而我给你们带来了小炒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A test is upon you, and I'm giving out the cheat sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.44,0:26:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.33,0:26:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我前来劝降 因为我知道你们通情达理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come salved with the hope that it is my dropped knowledge that you heed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有选择余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Options are zero to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.49,0:26:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠诚服从是唯一出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compliance and fealty are your only escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.52,0:26:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说白了 你们可生 亦或死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom-lining it … you may thrive, or you may die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真心希望是前者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sincerely wish for the former.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.83,0:26:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为所有人着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everyone's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.27,0:26:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经完全暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jig is up and in full effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.57,0:26:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吗 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you comply, rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.04,0:27:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.75,0:27:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.44,0:29:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.33,0:29:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We win.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.95,0:29:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听过叫瑞克的小傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever hear the one about the stupid little prick named rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.14,0:29:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为自己本事大却一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}who thought he knew shit but didn't know shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.16,0:29:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,害自己在乎的人被杀光的故事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got everyone he that gave a shit about killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.93,0:29:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.66,0:29:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好都把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all gonna wanna put your guns down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.12,0:29:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人别放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one drops anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.02,0:29:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.52,0:29:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔米尔去拿船上物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamiel came for the boat things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.36,0:29:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟踪了夺走物资的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Followed ones who took.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.95,0:29:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了笔更好的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made a better deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.92,0:30:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一而再 再而三地逼我 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You push me, and you push me. And you push me, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.52,0:30:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才想炸了我们是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just tried to blow us up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.06,0:30:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想弄死我 我的人 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I get me, my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.78,0:30:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是尤金呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.89,0:30:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.86,0:30:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做了那事之后 他洗心革面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after what he did … he stepped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.75,0:30:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}are animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.42,0:30:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝给了你们启示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Universe gives you a sign, and you just.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.22,0:30:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们却回了个中指 捅了他的菊花\N{\fnArial\fs30}shove your finger right up its ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.70,0:30:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,德怀特 西蒙 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwight, Simon, chop-chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们不喜欢尤金了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you don't like Eugene anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.29,0:31:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们肯定喜欢萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys gotta like Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.93,0:31:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.99,0:31:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了方便你们 我把她装在这里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got her right here packaged for your convenience,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.91,0:31:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫发无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.72,0:31:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带来了她 就不用杀了你们所有人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I brought her so I wouldn't have to kill all of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.07,0:31:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不把你们都杀了 事情会变得很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not killing all of you could get complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:32:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道里面还有很多武器 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I know there's a lot of firepower left in there, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.33,0:32:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的要求很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna make this simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.14,0:32:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们想方设法积攒来的所有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want all the guns you've managed to scrape up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.05,0:32:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这个我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, I know about those, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.59,0:32:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们剩下的所有柠檬粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every last grain of lemonade you got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.96,0:32:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要你选一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a person of your own choosing…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.43,0:32:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,送给露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Lucille.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.25,0:32:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得要回我的达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, I gotta get me my Daryl back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.09,0:32:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.04,0:32:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有台球桌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the pool table.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.80,0:32:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部台球杆和巧粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the pool cues and chalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.48,0:32:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.48,0:32:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然萨沙就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Sasha dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.82,0:32:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们所有人都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.05,0:32:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.48,0:32:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.32,0:33:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她装在棺材里带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because I brought her in a casket.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不意味着她就得死在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean she has to leave in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.31,0:33:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.34,0:33:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逊毙了 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suck ass, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.12,0:33:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.67,0:33:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to have to kill her,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.45,0:33:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这正是你要逼我做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's exactly what you're gonna make me do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.96,0:33:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.75,0:33:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给我点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.78,0:33:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许得跟她说说现在什么情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have to get her up to speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.32,0:33:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在棺材里可什么都听不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hear shit inside this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.17,0:33:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sash.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.10,0:33:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对不会相信这破事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna believe this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.34,0:33:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt real.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.53,0:33:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.18,0:34:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是失去了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we lost this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.80,0:34:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.87,0:34:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- C'mon. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.45,0:34:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你看穿我的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the way you call bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.69,0:34:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这次让我来帮帮你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.90,0:34:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来你要跟我说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next thing you're gonna tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.05,0:34:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会去 这样我就可以留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you'll go and that I can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.69,0:35:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道 你自己也不想说出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know you didn't like hearing yourself just say.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.01,0:35:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「玛姬应该靠自己」这种话\N{\fnArial\fs30}that, "Maggie's gotta take care of Maggie."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.76,0:35:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这句话会回荡在你脑中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know those words are gonna choke in your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.60,0:35:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}a good, long while.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.79,0:35:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会因为仅仅有这念头而做出补偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna wanna make up for even thinking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.30,0:35:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说得对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.09,0:35:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.24,0:35:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为别人置生死于度外\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lay our big meaties across the chopping block ahead of someone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.48,0:35:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是为别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.80,0:35:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道 如果我们要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of us know, if we're gonna kick,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.79,0:35:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那最好死得有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}there sure as hell better be a point to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.78,0:35:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以或许我们觉得这一切都是有意义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe we feel there was a-a point to all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.39,0:35:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,自始至终\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha to omega.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.98,0:35:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是在战场 还是在海边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether it's on the battlefield or the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.73,0:35:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是别的什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}or somewhere out there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.17,0:35:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.37,0:35:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怀着未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's carrying the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.57,0:36:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.35,0:36:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这会如何结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew how this was gonna end.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.01,0:36:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.24,0:36:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为别人冒生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Layin' your ass on the line for someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.94,0:36:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他们扫除障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tearin' it to shreds for 'em …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.84,0:36:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.51,0:36:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才叫活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my, that is living.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.25,0:36:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.93,0:36:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没说过我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never said otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.25,0:37:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那里要几个小时 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple hours to get there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.03,0:37:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.62,0:37:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上也许障碍重重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be a circuitous and janky route.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.04,0:37:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于他们在谋反 道路很可能被监视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what they're planning, they could be watching the roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.09,0:37:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他们在谋反」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What they're planning."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.79,0:37:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.64,0:37:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在市集拿的 存满了歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it in the marketplace. It's chock-full.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.00,0:37:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旅途中恐怕无法交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doubt conversation will be on tap for the commute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.47,0:37:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我是个自私的懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And though I am a selfish coward,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.89,0:37:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有时也会为别人着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do tend to think of other people on occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.13,0:37:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,请收下我的馈赠吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take it with my compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.47,0:37:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的希望我能做好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly wish I measured up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.95,0:37:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你依然可以 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still can, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.88,0:37:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.27,0:37:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会放弃你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.22,0:37:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你不用躺在那玩意儿里面过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, you don't have to take the trip in the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.23,0:37:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.75,0:37:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.34,0:37:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.33,0:37:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.49,0:38:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一小杯水就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a little bottle of water, and I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.70,0:38:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arat?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.66,0:38:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.91,0:38:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这有多难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how tough this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.88,0:38:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.24,0:38:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 你真了不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, you are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.16,0:38:48.81,Title,0,0,0,0,,（正在播放 《总有一天 我们都会自由》 唐尼·海瑟威）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.54,0:39:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sash.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.63,0:39:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对不会相信这破事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna believe this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.29,0:39:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.31,0:40:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.63,0:40:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.47,0:40:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! honey, god damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.34,0:40:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就后备计划吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan "B" It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.18,0:41:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.61,0:41:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以重新做笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make another deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.48,0:41:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.68,0:42:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.49,0:42:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下 不然再吃一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down. Or again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.72,0:43:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, shit, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.48,0:43:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能老实跟着我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just couldn't stick with us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.20,0:43:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,非要找这些捡破烂的脏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to go with these filthy garbage people?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.37,0:43:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.97,0:43:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说好了是12个 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal is for 12, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.38,0:43:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,10个\N{\fnArial\fs30}10.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.30,0:43:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,人才是资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are a resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.61,0:43:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,12个\N{\fnArial\fs30}12.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.50,0:43:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,10个挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}10.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.97,0:43:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.90,0:43:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让你难过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just gonna make you sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.61,0:43:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.37,0:43:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会希望你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wish you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.31,0:43:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢闹着玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.80,0:44:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.65,0:44:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许你觉得对你朋友做出那种事的人不是我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe you think that the guy that did what he did to your friends wasn't me,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.08,0:44:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为那不过是某种作秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}like that was some sort of a put-on,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.73,0:44:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我不是拿着大棒的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I'm not the guy with the bat …
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.74,0:44:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个给你孩子做意面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just the guy that makes your kid spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.33,0:44:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.13,0:44:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.73,0:44:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这全都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is all on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.76,0:44:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须纠正错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.68,0:44:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜又要重来一遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I gotta start all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.89,0:44:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须告诉你 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta tell you, Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.32,0:44:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I had a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.71,0:44:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他跟你孩子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd want him to be just like your kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.81,0:44:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这就更难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which makes this so much harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.50,0:44:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.19,0:44:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.20,0:44:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.17,0:44:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不用你的独眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you point your one ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.02,0:44:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那边 感受一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}up the street there and take it all in?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.37,0:45:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll win!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.48,0:45:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.62,0:45:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.83,0:45:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.19,0:45:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚失去了某个重要的人 就在刚刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just lost somebody important to you right now … like, just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.29,0:45:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.71,0:45:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.33,0:46:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Rick…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.11,0:46:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you chose this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.08,0:46:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道我还能怎么警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly don't know what more I could've done to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.83,0:46:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这不是警告了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this isn't a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.22,0:46:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.38,0:46:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要杀了卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill Carl now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.82,0:46:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会狠狠地 重重地挥一棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make it one nice, hard swing,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.62,0:46:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着一击毙命 因为我喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}try to do it in one because I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.26,0:46:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想让你把这个念头放进脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to put that in your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.01,0:46:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,细细回味一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and roll it around for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.42,0:46:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了卡尔 然后露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill Carl, and then Lucille here,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.88,0:46:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会砸烂你的双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's gonna take your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.74,0:46:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以就在我面前做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.63,0:46:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以砸烂我的双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.17,0:46:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经告诉过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you already …
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.36,0:46:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.88,0:46:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.68,0:47:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不在今天 也许不在明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not today, maybe not tomorrow…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.20,0:47:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有什么能改变这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing is gonna change that …
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.76,0:47:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.02,0:47:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.50,0:47:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.65,0:47:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.50,0:47:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.04,0:47:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说了我可以做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.53,0:48:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭了救世军和他们的同伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}End these Saviors and their accomplices!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.97,0:48:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山大不会陷落 不在今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexandria will not fall, not on this day!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.72,0:48:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,方阵队形 第三队 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phalanx out, third group, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.13,0:48:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上 我们掩护你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move up! Now we got your backs!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.67,0:48:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的一头老虎啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A goddamn tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.51,0:48:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那寡妇没死 活蹦乱跳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That widow is alive, guns a-blazin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.50,0:49:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尝到了吗 西蒙 这就是吃屎的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taste that, Simon? That is the taste of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.84,0:50:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们撤退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're falling back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.29,0:50:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华多 伯蒂 去房屋之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eduardo, Bertie, between the houses …
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.86,0:50:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.49,0:50:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.76,0:50:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在收尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we finish this!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.15,0:51:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.43,0:51:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull!?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.56,0:52:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.52,0:52:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne.?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.53,0:52:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.68,0:53:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We … W-We're…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.49,0:53:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.55,0:53:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know.?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.23,0:53:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.64,0:53:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.07,0:53:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.11,0:53:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备已就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting preparations in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.37,0:53:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都是蓝色警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's on "Blue level."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.26,0:53:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你下令 他们就出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say the word, they're ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.82,0:53:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.24,0:54:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她怎么会死在棺材里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell do you think she wound up dead in that box?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.44,0:54:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,最可能的原因是油布\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, um, best possible posit fingers the tarp.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.66,0:54:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,棺材被封得严严实实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sealed up said box good and tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.59,0:54:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用完了空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ran out of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.13,0:54:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.87,0:55:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.67,0:55:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are going to war!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.63,0:55:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.04,0:55:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得萨沙是一个人做到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think Sasha did that herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.72,0:55:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么做到的 但我知道她做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how, but I know she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.69,0:55:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给了我们机会 你给了我们机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave us a chance. You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.70,0:55:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择过来是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made the right decision to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.42,0:55:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这选择很早以前就做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The decision was made a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.77,0:55:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们大家相识之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before any of us knew each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.54,0:55:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们还是在街上擦肩而过的陌生人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we were all strangers who would have just passed each other on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.56,0:55:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界结束之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the world ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.33,0:56:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们对彼此意味着一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we mean everything to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.48,0:56:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇到了麻烦 你陷入了困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in trouble. You were trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.52,0:56:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦不认识你 但他救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn didn't know you, but he helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.17,0:56:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为你冒了生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put himself in danger for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.01,0:56:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一切的源头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that started it all …
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.59,0:57:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从亚特兰大 到我爸爸的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Atlanta, to my daddy's farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.14,0:57:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,到监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.81,0:57:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to here…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.04,0:57:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}to this moment now…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.72,0:57:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不再是陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not as strangers …
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.47,0:57:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}as family…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.21,0:57:53.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（当时不知道）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.39,0:58:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为格伦那天选择救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because Glenn chose to be there for you that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.10,0:58:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.85,0:58:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那个选择改变了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the decision that changed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.59,0:58:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们俩发起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started with both of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.98,0:58:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后不断壮大\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it just grew…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.43,0:58:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to all of us…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.81,0:58:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为彼此做出牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sacrifice for each other…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.53,0:58:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,承受苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}to suffer and stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.77,0:58:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哀悼 去给予\N{\fnArial\fs30}to grieve, to give,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.85,0:59:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,去爱 去生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}to love, to live…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.17,0:59:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,去为彼此而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fight for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.42,0:59:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦做出了那个选择 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn made the decision, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.90,0:59:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是在追随他的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just following his lead.
